 "text": "\nكهرباء شرق الدلتا \nشركة الإنتاج\nالعريش \nقوة Station\nانقر على الروابط أدناه للوصول إلى الوثيقة المطلوبة.\n13/8/2008\n13/8/2008\npH Meter Model 3305 \nشركة جينواي المملكة المتحدة \n قياس درجة الحموضة، ودرجة الحرارة، بالسيارات\nConductivity Meter Model 4310 Measure\nConductivity\n14/8/2008\nWater-051-r0a\nالصيانة \n الدورية لوحدة معالجة الصرف الصحى\n13/6/2006\nTD-PS-003-r0\nSanitary Waste \n Water Treatment Plant\n22/11/04\n20/11/04\nتعليمات خاصة بتشغيل محطة كهرباء \n العريش البخارية وحدة معالجة الصرف الصحى\nباستخدام كتالوج \n المحطة\n13/6/2006\nالمواد الكيميائية\n28/11/04\n28/11/04\n29/06/05\n29/06/05\n28/03/05\nقسري \n Draft Fan NDV 21 H, BHEL - India, \n Y5\n10/09/06\nMain Boiler Wash Water \n Drain Sump Pump, \nSHs \n 65/32 NE, India, Y1\n03/11/04\nSteam Transformer Pumps, Re-Boiler Feed \n Water Pumps Horizontal Centrifugal Pump, Secondary Condensate Pump Horizontal, \n Condensate Return Pump,\n KPD3212GQF, KPD2512GQF, KPD25/16QF, Y5\n03/11/04\nP-056-r0\n04/11/04\nP-057-r0\nMain Boiler Blow Down Drain Sump Pumps, \n 25NKS125, INDIA,Y5\n03/11/04\n27/03/05\n27/03/05\nClosed Cycle Cooling \n Water Pump, BC06G, \nAUDOLI & BERTOLA, Y5\n10/09/06\n23/03/06\nMain Circulating Water \n Pump, 45 CIPP AR 155, \nTermomeccanica, M6\n10/08/05\n14/08/05\n14/08/05\n14/08/05\n06/04/06\n09/04/06\nمكثف\nMAG10-HA001, \n 10% PluggingTubes \n BELLELI, SDA\n07/09/06\n17/08/06\nDCS-001-r0\nDistributed \n Control System DCS Cabinet, \nمراقبة الجودة، \nQSE \n(16) Channel Contact Input, \nبطاقات الإدخال الرقمية، Types: 7379A06G02, 7380A36G01, Westinghouse \n Y1\n17/01/04\nDCS-002-r0\nDistributed \n Control System DCS Cabinet,\nQAV (6) Channel, \nQRT \n(4) Channel, \nAnalogue Input Cards, Types: 7379A21G01, \n7379A62G02, \n Westinghouse, Y1\n17/01/04\nDCS-003-r0\nDistributed \n Control System DCS Cabinet,\nQAW (6) Channel, \n4 to 20 mA, Analogue Input Card, يكتب: \n 7379A31G04, Westinghouse Y1\n17/01/04\nDCS-004-r0\nDistributed \n Control System DCS Cabinet,\nQRO (8) Channel, \n4 to 20 mA, Digital Output Card, يكتب: \n 2840A18G01, Westinghouse\n17/01/04\n19/09/04\n19/09/04\n19/09/04\nCV-001-r0\nAuma Control valve, SAREX 10.1-F10, Y1 \nCV test sheet\n07/05/03\nTrt-001-r0\nTransmitters, \n Y1 \nTrt test sheet\n07/05/03\nTI-001-r0\n07/05/03\nPI-001-r0\n07/05/03\nTS-001-r0\n07/05/03\nPS-001-r0\n07/05/03\nThC-001-r0\n07/05/03\nRTD-001-r0\n07/05/03\n04/05/04\n04/05/04\n01/12/04\n07/12/04\nSF6 Circuit Breaker, 17.5kv, \n SACE, ABB, Y1\n09/05/05\n09/05/05\n09/05/05\n09/05/05\n09/05/05\n09/05/05\n09/05/05\n09/05/05\n09/05/05\n25/10/04\n25/10/04\n25/10/04\n25/10/04\n25/10/04\nPC-001-r0\nبطاقة الصيانة ل \nتتابع الحماية \nالصفحة الخلفية\nAll\n",
